License
=======

This repository has three separately licensed parts. Source attributions in
README.md are part of the record and should be kept when you reuse the data.

Data (`data/`)
--------------

The genealogy data under `data/` is derived from Wikipedia, chiefly the
Chinese Wikipedia article 《相声演员师承关系》 and related performer articles.
Wikipedia text is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

`data/` is therefore released under CC BY-SA 4.0. If you share or adapt it,
give appropriate credit, link to the license, indicate changes, and distribute
your contributions under the same license. Keep the source attributions in
README.md and the per-record `sources` fields.

Facts cross-checked against jammyfu/xiangsheng-genealogy (MIT) are cited in
those record sources. That project's code was not copied.

